      "updated": 1778047397749,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " Headless Browser (Fully Automated)\n\n  A real browser (Chrome) runs invisibly in the background. Your code controls it\n  completely — no human involved.\n\n  # Playwright example — fully automated\n  async with async_playwright() as p:\n      browser = await p.chromium.launch(headless=True)  # invisible browser\n      page = await browser.new_page()\n      await page.goto(\"https://land.naver.com/search\")\n      await page.fill(\"#budget\", \"2000000\")\n      await page.click(\"#search-btn\")\n      results = await page.query_selector_all(\".item\")  # grab all listings\n\n  Compliance profile:\n\n  ┌────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │       Factor       │                 Reality                 │\n  ├────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n  │ Speed              │ Can scrape hundreds of pages per minute │\n  ├────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n  │ Human involvement  │ Zero — runs while you sleep             │\n  ├────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n  │ Detectability      │ Sites can detect headless browsers      │\n  ├────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n  │ ToS risk           │ Higher — looks like a bot attack        │\n  ├────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n  │ robots.txt respect │ Only if you code it in manually         │\n  └────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n  ---\n  Semi-Manual (Human-in-the-Loop)\n\n  Your code opens a real browser that you can see. It navigates and extracts data, but\n  you watch it and control the pace. Sometimes you click yourself.\n\n  # Playwright example — visible browser, you watch it\n  async with async_playwright() as p:\n      browser = await p.chromium.launch(headless=False)  # visible browser\n      page = await browser.new_page()\n      await page.goto(\"https://land.naver.com/search\")\n      input(\"Fill in the form manually, then press Enter...\")  # you interact\n      results = await page.query_selector_all(\".item\")\n\n  Compliance profile:\n\n  ┌────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │       Factor       │                        Reality                        │\n  ├────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n  │ Speed              │ Slow — human pace                                     │\n  ├────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n  │ Human involvement  │ You're present and watching                           │\n  ├────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n  │ Detectability      │ Looks like a real user                                │\n  ├────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n  │ ToS risk           │ Much lower — hard to distinguish from normal browsing │\n  ├────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n  │ robots.txt respect │ Natural — you're not mass-crawling                    │\n  └────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n  ---\n  Side by Side\n\n  ┌────────────────────┬───────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────┐\n  │                    │         Headless          │          Semi-Manual          │\n  ├────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┤\n  │ Speed              │ Fast                      │ Slow                          │\n  ├────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┤\n  │ Effort             │ None after setup          │ Requires your attention       │\n  ├────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┤\n  │ Compliance risk    │ Higher                    │ Lower                         │\n  ├────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┤\n  │ Good for           │ Large scale data          │ Personal use, occasional      │\n  │                    │ collection                │ search                        │\n  ├────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┤\n  │ Fits your use      │ Overkill                  │ Yes — perfect fit             │\n  │ case?              │                           │                               │\n  └────────────────────┴───────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────┘\n\n  ---\n  My Recommendation for Your Case\n\n  Semi-manual is the right choice for now. You're doing personal searches occasionally\n  — not building a data pipeline. It's lower risk, lower complexity, and honestly more\n  appropriate for a beginner's first project.\n\n  Once you're comfortable, headless automation is a natural upgrade for v2.\n\n  Want to move on to the full roadmap now?",
      "fontSize": 2.7424291234843965,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": " Headless Browser (Fully Automated)\n\n  A real browser (Chrome) runs invisibly in the background. Your code controls it\n  completely — no human involved.\n\n  # Playwright example — fully automated\n  async with async_playwright() as p:\n      browser = await p.chromium.launch(headless=True)  # invisible browser\n      page = await browser.new_page()\n      await page.goto(\"https://land.naver.com/search\")\n      await page.fill(\"#budget\", \"2000000\")\n      await page.click(\"#search-btn\")\n      results = await page.query_selector_all(\".item\")  # grab all listings\n\n  Compliance profile:\n\n  ┌────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │       Factor       │                 Reality                 │\n  ├────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n  │ Speed              │ Can scrape hundreds of pages per minute │\n  ├────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n  │ Human involvement  │ Zero — runs while you sleep             │\n  ├────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n  │ Detectability      │ Sites can detect headless browsers      │\n  ├────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n  │ ToS risk           │ Higher — looks like a bot attack        │\n  ├────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n  │ robots.txt respect │ Only if you code it in manually         │\n  └────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n  ---\n  Semi-Manual (Human-in-the-Loop)\n\n  Your code opens a real browser that you can see. It navigates and extracts data, but\n  you watch it and control the pace. Sometimes you click yourself.\n\n  # Playwright example — visible browser, you watch it\n  async with async_playwright() as p:\n      browser = await p.chromium.launch(headless=False)  # visible browser\n      page = await browser.new_page()\n      await page.goto(\"https://land.naver.com/search\")\n      input(\"Fill in the form manually, then press Enter...\")  # you interact\n      results = await page.query_selector_all(\".item\")\n\n  Compliance profile:\n\n  ┌────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │       Factor       │                        Reality                        │\n  ├────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n  │ Speed              │ Slow — human pace                                     │\n  ├────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n  │ Human involvement  │ You're present and watching                           │\n  ├────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n  │ Detectability      │ Looks like a real user                                │\n  ├────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n  │ ToS risk           │ Much lower — hard to distinguish from normal browsing │\n  ├────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n  │ robots.txt respect │ Natural — you're not mass-crawling                    │\n  └────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n  ---\n  Side by Side\n\n  ┌────────────────────┬───────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────┐\n  │                    │         Headless          │          Semi-Manual          │\n  ├────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┤\n  │ Speed              │ Fast                      │ Slow                          │\n  ├────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┤\n  │ Effort             │ None after setup          │ Requires your attention       │\n  ├────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┤\n  │ Compliance risk    │ Higher                    │ Lower                         │\n  ├────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┤\n  │ Good for           │ Large scale data          │ Personal use, occasional      │\n  │                    │ collection                │ search                        │\n  ├────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┤\n  │ Fits your use      │ Overkill                  │ Yes — perfect fit             │\n  │ case?              │                           │                               │\n  └────────────────────┴───────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────┘\n\n  ---\n  My Recommendation for Your Case\n\n  Semi-manual is the right choice for now. You're doing personal searches occasionally\n  — not building a data pipeline. It's lower risk, lower complexity, and honestly more\n  appropriate for a beginner's first project.\n\n  Once you're comfortable, headless automation is a natural upgrade for v2.\n\n  Want to move on to the full roadmap now?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
